{
  "body_human_readable": "## Weather in Kyiv: Cloudy with a Chance of Snow\n\nAs of Tuesday in Kyiv, the weather is currently cloudy with a temperature of 39\u00b0F (4\u00b0C). There is a light drizzle and a 15% chance of snow. The humidity is approximately 79%.\n\nTonight, the weather is expected to feature snow showers, with the temperature dropping to around 33\u00b0F (1\u00b0C). The chance of snow will increase to 35%.\n\nLooking ahead, Wednesday will bring more snow showers during the day with a high near 33\u00b0F (1\u00b0C) and become cloudy at night with a low of 27\u00b0F (-3\u00b0C). The rest of the week is forecasted to be cloudy with temperatures remaining near or below freezing.",
